# Ownership follows the isolation model (ADR-0004): an app team owns its own app directory and
# nothing else; any change touching the platform pulls in the platform team. Later rules win.
#
# Team handles are placeholders until this lives in a GitHub org. GitHub skips lines whose owners
# cannot be resolved, so this file documents intent today and enforces it on org import.

*                               @insights-hub/platform

/apps/people-analytics-comp/    @insights-hub/people-analytics
/apps/finance-nightly-rollup/   @insights-hub/finance

# The manifest is a platform contract even though it lives inside the app.
/apps/*/platform.toml           @insights-hub/platform
